    description: "The _stale_pr_audit() function in .agent/hooks/_shared/stop_logic.sh calls load_env and detect_api_base but does NOT call apply_failover_overrides(). During CI failover, this queries origin (Codeberg) instead of selfh. PR #2690 keeps appearing as stale across sessions. Fix: add apply_failover_overrides() after detect_api_base at ~line 360."  # 6c12
