  message: "Fixed in PR #134. Root cause: _stale_pr_audit() in stop_logic.sh did not call apply_failover_overrides() after detect_api_base, so it always queried origin (Codeberg) even during failover. One-line fix: added apply_failover_overrides() call."  # c144
